SIMPLE  =                    T / file does conform to FITS standard             BITPIX  =                    8 / number of bits per data pixel                  NAXIS   =                    0 / number of data axes                            EXTEND  =                    T / FITS dataset may contain extensions            COMMENT   FITS (Flexible Image Transport System) format is defined in 'AstronomyCOMMENT   and Astrophysics', volume 376, page 359; bibcode: 2001A&A...376..359H INPUT   = 'rogue_5_data.fits'                                                   EXTNAME = 'SEGMENT-CONFIG'     / HDU name                                                                                                                                             / Option values                                           HDU     = '0       '           / HDU containing values (science image).         TILESIZE= '30,30   '           / Regular tile size on dim.s (FITS order).       HIERARCH NUMCHANNELS = '1,1     ' / No. of channels in dim.s (FITS order).      HIERARCH REMAINDERFRAC =   0.1 / Fraction of remainder to split last tile.      HIERARCH WORKOVERCH =        0 / Work (not tile) over channel edges.            HIERARCH INTERPONLYBLANK =   0 / Only interpolate over the blank tiles.         HIERARCH INTERPMETRIC = 'radial  ' / Interpolation metric (radial, manhattan).  HIERARCH INTERPNUMNGB =     15 / No. of neighbors to use for interpolation.     HIERARCH TABLEFORMAT = 'fits-binary' / 'txt', 'fits-ascii', 'fits-binary'.      HIERARCH WCSLINEARMATRIX = 'pc      ' / WCS linear matrix of output ('pc' or 'cdHIERARCH MINMAPSIZE = 9223372036854775807 / Min. bytes to avoid RAM automaticallHIERARCH QUIETMMAP =         0 / Don't print mmap'd file's name and size.       SKYHDU  = 'SKY     '           / HDU containing Sky value to subtract.          STD     = '1       '           / Filename of Sky standard deviation.            STDHDU  = 'SKY_STD '           / HDU containing Sky standard deviation.         HIERARCH DETECTION = 'rogue_5_mask.fits' / Filename of detection image (to segmeDHDU    = '1       '           / HDU containing detection image.                KHDU    = '1       '           / HDU containing kernel image.                   CHDU    = '1       '           / HDU/extension of convolved image in file.      HIERARCH CONTINUEAFTERCHECK = 0 / Continue processing after checks.             HIERARCH LARGETILESIZE = '200,200 ' / Sim. to --tilesize, but for larger tiles. HIERARCH MINSKYFRAC =      0.6 / Min. fraction of undetected area in tile.      HIERARCH SNMINAREA =        15 / Minimum area of clumps for S/N estimation.     HIERARCH MINNUMFALSE =     100 / Minimum number for S/N estimation.             SNQUANT =                 0.95 / S/N Quantile of true sky clumps.               HIERARCH KEEPMAXNEARRIVER =  0 / Keep clumps with peak touching a river.        HIERARCH CLUMPSNTHRESH =    3. / S/N threshold of true clumps.                  GTHRESH =                  0.5 / Multiple of STD to stop growing clumps.        HIERARCH MINRIVERLENGTH =   15 / Minimum len of useful grown clump rivers.      HIERARCH OBJBORDERSN =      1. / Min. S/N for grown clumps as one object.                                                                                                             / Versions and date                                       DATE    = '2026-06-12T16:50:25' / [YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss] Date processing started.DATEUTC =                    1 / [bool] If 'DATE' is in UTC, value is '1'.      CFITSIO = '4.6.3   '           / Version of CFITSIO used.                       WCSLIB  = '8.2.2   '           / Version of WCSLIB used.                        GSL     = '2.7     '           / Version of GNU Scientific Library used.        GNUASTRO= '0.24    '           / Version of GNU Astronomy Utilities used.       END                                                                                                                                                             